    "updated_at": "2024-11-21T07:19:14Z",
    "body": "I'll try to look into this in more detail later, but have you looked at what the reference implementation does in this case? It passes all the tests, including the one you're simplifying, so either the spec is correct already in some way, or there's a bug in the reference implementation which maybe could inspire us on how to fix the spec.",
