    "created_at": "2024-11-21T07:31:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-11-21T07:31:22Z",
    "body": "It looks like it will catch the null strategy size algorithm exception: https://github.com/whatwg/streams/blob/8ebee1f90aba26269afc57f7487bf1418987e7cb/reference-implementation/lib/abstract-ops/writable-streams.js#L667\r\n\r\nWhich seems a bit, off. At least to me doesn't read like editorially that it could be null and it feels like there should be a cleaner way to order the steps, e.g by _maybe_ clearing the algorithms at a different time.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
